    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="题解"><a href="#题解" class="headerlink" title="题解"></a>题解</h1><span id="more"></span><h2 id="LeetCode1689题目详情"><a href="#LeetCode1689题目详情" class="headerlink" title="LeetCode1689题目详情"></a>LeetCode1689<a href="https://leetcode.cn/problems/partitioning-into-minimum-number-of-deci-binary-numbers/description/">题目详情</a></h2><h3 id="题目"><a href="#题目" class="headerlink" title="题目"></a>题目</h3><p>如果一个十进制数字不含任何前导零，且每一位上的数字不是 <code>0</code> 就是 <code>1</code> ，那么该数字就是一个 十-二进制数 。例如，<code>101</code> 和 <code>1100</code> 都是 十-二进制数，而 <code>112</code> 和 <code>3001</code> 不是。</p><p>给你一个表示十进制整数的字符串 <code>n</code> ，返回和为 <code>n</code>的 十-二进制数 的最少数目。</p><ul><li><code>1 &lt;= n.length &lt;= 105</code></li><li><code>n</code> 仅由数字组成</li><li><code>n</code> 不含任何前导零并总是表示正整数</li></ul><h3 id="思路"><a href="#思路" class="headerlink" title="思路"></a>思路</h3><p>因为十-二进制数每一位上的数字不是<code>0</code>就是<code>1</code>，则对于<code>n</code>上任意一位，只能由十-二进制数相应数位上<code>0</code>、<code>1</code>相加得到，那么只需要比较不同数位上的数字，找到最大的数字即可。</p><h3 id="示例代码1"><a href="#示例代码1" class="headerlink" title="示例代码1"></a>示例代码1</h3><figure class="highlight excel"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs excel">#include &lt;string.h&gt;<br><span class="hljs-built_in">int</span> minPartitions(<span class="hljs-built_in">char</span>* <span class="hljs-built_in">n</span>) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">max</span> = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-built_in">len</span> = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">len</span> = strlen(<span class="hljs-built_in">n</span>);<br>    for(<span class="hljs-built_in">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;i &lt; <span class="hljs-built_in">len</span>;i++)&#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">if</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">max</span> &lt; <span class="hljs-built_in">n</span>[i] - <span class="hljs-number">48</span>)&#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-built_in">max</span> = <span class="hljs-built_in">n</span>[i] - <span class="hljs-number">48</span>;<br>        &#125;<br>    &#125;<br>    return <span class="hljs-built_in">max</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="分析"><a href="#分析" class="headerlink" title="分析"></a>分析</h3><p>时间复杂度：O(N) 击败 36.49%<br>空间复杂度：O(1) 击败 13.51%</p><h3 id="示例代码2"><a href="#示例代码2" class="headerlink" title="示例代码2"></a>示例代码2</h3><figure class="highlight arduino"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs arduino"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;string.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">minPartitions</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">char</span>* n)</span> </span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> max = <span class="hljs-number">1</span>, len = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>    len = <span class="hljs-built_in">strlen</span>(n);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span>(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;i &lt; len;i++)&#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(max &lt; n[i] - <span class="hljs-number">48</span>)&#123;<br>            max = n[i] - <span class="hljs-number">48</span>;<br>        &#125;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span>(max == <span class="hljs-number">9</span>)&#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;<br>        &#125;<br>    &#125;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> max;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="分析-1"><a href="#分析-1" class="headerlink" title="分析"></a>分析</h3><p>时间复杂度：O(N) 击败 100%<br>空间复杂度：O(1) 击败 13.51%</p><h2 id="LeetCode1545题目详情"><a href="#LeetCode1545题目详情" class="headerlink" title="LeetCode1545题目详情"></a>LeetCode1545<a href="https://leetcode.cn/problems/find-kth-bit-in-nth-binary-string/description/">题目详情</a></h2><h3 id="题目-1"><a href="#题目-1" class="headerlink" title="题目"></a>题目</h3><p>给你两个正整数 <code>n</code> 和 <code>k</code>，二进制字符串 <code>Sₙ</code> 的形成规则如下：</p><ul><li><code>S₁ = &quot;0&quot; </code></li><li>当 <code>i &gt; 1</code> 时，<code>Sᵢ = Sᵢ₋₁ + &quot;1&quot; + reverse(invert(Sᵢ₋₁))</code><br>其中 <code>+</code> 表示串联操作，<code>reverse(x)</code> 返回反转 <code>x</code> 后得到的字符串，而 <code>invert(x)</code> 则会翻转 <code>x</code> 中的每一位（<code>0</code> 变为 <code>1</code>，而 <code>1</code> 变为 <code>0</code>）。</li></ul><p>例如，符合上述描述的序列的前 4 个字符串依次是：</p><ul><li><code>S₁ = &quot;0&quot;</code></li><li><code>S₂ = &quot;011&quot;</code></li><li><code>S₃ = &quot;0111001&quot;</code></li><li><code>S₄ = &quot;011100110110001&quot;</code></li></ul><p>请你返回<code>Sₙ</code>的第<code>k</code>位字符，题目数据保证<code>k</code>一定在<code>Sₙ</code>长度范围以内。</p><h3 id="思路-1"><a href="#思路-1" class="headerlink" title="思路"></a>思路</h3><p>第 <code>n</code> 个二进制字符串可以由第 <code>n-1</code> 个推导得到。第 <code>k</code> 位也是从第 1 个二进制字符串的第 1 位得到的。利用递归和二分的思想，即可得到答案。</p><p>容易得到，第 <code>n</code> 个字符串的长度为 2<sup>n-1</sup> 。只需要比较 <code>k</code> 与 2<sup>n-1</sup> 的大小。当 <code>k</code> 大于 2<sup>n-1</sup> 时，说明 <code>k</code> 时由2<sup>n</sup> - k 位翻转得到，2<sup>n-1</sup> - k 在第 <code>n-1</code> 个二进制字符串内 ；当 <code>k</code> 小于 2<sup>n-1</sup> 时，证明第 <code>k</code> 位在第 <code>n-1</code> 个二进制字符串内。</p><p>以此类推，一般地，可以得到 <code>n = 1</code> ， <code>k = 1</code>。可以使用 <code>sum</code> 来记录 <code>k</code> 翻转的次数。<code>sum</code> 为奇数时，原来的第 <code>k</code> 位为 <code>1</code>，<code>sum</code> 为偶数时，原来的第 <code>k</code> 位为 <code>0</code>，</p><p>特殊地，<code>k</code> 正好等于 2<sup>n-1</sup>。此时我们已经得知这位为 <code>1</code>，只需要结束递归，并观察 <code>sum</code> 的值即可，即 <code>sum</code> 为奇数时，原来的第 <code>k</code> 位为 <code>0</code>， <code>sum</code> 为偶数时，原来的第 <code>k</code> 位为 <code>1</code>。</p><h3 id="示例代码"><a href="#示例代码" class="headerlink" title="示例代码"></a>示例代码</h3><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;math.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">char</span> <span class="hljs-title">findKthBit</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> n, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> k)</span> </span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> sum = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (n == <span class="hljs-number">1</span>)<br>    &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;0&#x27;</span>;<br>    &#125;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> (n &gt; <span class="hljs-number">1</span>)<br>    &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (k &gt; <span class="hljs-built_in">pow</span>(<span class="hljs-number">2</span>, n - <span class="hljs-number">1</span>))<br>        &#123;<br>            k = <span class="hljs-built_in">pow</span>(<span class="hljs-number">2</span>, n) - k;<br>            n = n - <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;<br>            sum++;<br>        &#125;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (k == <span class="hljs-built_in">pow</span>(<span class="hljs-number">2</span>, n - <span class="hljs-number">1</span>))<br>        &#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;<br>        &#125;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span><br>        &#123;<br>            n = n - <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;<br>        &#125;<br>    &#125;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> ((sum % <span class="hljs-number">2</span> == <span class="hljs-number">0</span> &amp;&amp; k == <span class="hljs-number">1</span>)||(sum % <span class="hljs-number">2</span> != <span class="hljs-number">0</span> &amp;&amp; k != <span class="hljs-number">1</span>))<br>    &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;0&#x27;</span>;<br>    &#125;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span><br>    &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;1&#x27;</span>;<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="分析-2"><a href="#分析-2" class="headerlink" title="分析"></a>分析</h3><p>时间复杂度：O(LogN) 击败100%<br>空间复杂度：O(1) 击败11.43%</p><h2 id="LeetCode1582题目详情"><a href="#LeetCode1582题目详情" class="headerlink" title="LeetCode1582题目详情"></a>LeetCode1582<a href="https://leetcode.cn/problems/special-positions-in-a-binary-matrix/">题目详情</a></h2><h3 id="题目-2"><a href="#题目-2" class="headerlink" title="题目"></a>题目</h3><p>给定一个 <code>m x n</code> 的二进制矩阵 <code>mat</code>，返回矩阵 <code>mat</code> 中特殊位置的数量。</p><p>如果位置 <code>(i, j)</code> 满足 <code>mat[i][j] == 1</code> 并且行 <code>i</code> 与列 <code>j</code> 中的所有其他元素都是 <code>0</code>（行和列的下标从 <code>0</code> 开始计数），那么它被称为 特殊 位置。</p><h3 id="思路-2"><a href="#思路-2" class="headerlink" title="思路"></a>思路</h3><p>最简单的思路，先判断 <code>mat[i][j]</code> 是否为 <code>1</code> 。如果为 <code>1</code> ，进一步将 <code>i</code> 行的所有元素加起来，判断是否为 <code>1</code> ，如果为 <code>1</code> ，再对第 <code>j</code> 列进行相同的判断；如果<code>mat[i][j]</code> 不为 <code>1</code>，直接跳过，并检查下一个。</p><p>需要注意的是，在预设代码中的 <code>int matSize</code> 即一般意义上的行数，而 <code>int *matColSize</code> 可以理解为第 <code>i</code> 行的元素个数，即这道题中的列数。不过有些费解的是，为什么不使用题目中的 <code>m</code> <code>n</code>  作为行数和列数，而使用这种稍显麻烦的方式？笔者的理解为， <code>m</code> <code>n</code> 仅仅为一般意义上的行数与列数，在这种情况下， <code>mat</code> 构成的是“矩阵”，而使用 <code>int matSize</code>  <code>int *matColSize</code> 可以是不规则的。幸运的是这道题目仅仅讨论了矩阵，如果是不规则的，那么笔者的方法可能并不适用。</p><h3 id="示例代码-1"><a href="#示例代码-1" class="headerlink" title="示例代码"></a>示例代码</h3><figure class="highlight excel"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs excel"><span class="hljs-built_in">int</span> numSpecial(<span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>** mat, <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span> matSize, <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>* matColSize) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">sum</span> = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, <span class="hljs-built_in">count</span> = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>    for (<span class="hljs-built_in">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>; i &lt; matSize; i++) &#123;<br>        for (<span class="hljs-built_in">int</span> j = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>; j &lt; matColSize[i]; j++) &#123;<br>            <span class="hljs-built_in">if</span> (mat[i][j] != <span class="hljs-number">1</span>) &#123;<br>                continue;<br>            &#125; else &#123;<br>                for (<span class="hljs-built_in">int</span> m = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>; m &lt; matColSize[i]; m++) &#123;<br>                    <span class="hljs-built_in">sum</span> = <span class="hljs-built_in">sum</span> + mat[i][m];<br>                &#125;<br>                <span class="hljs-built_in">if</span> (<span class="hljs-built_in">sum</span> == <span class="hljs-number">1</span>) &#123;<br>                    for (<span class="hljs-built_in">int</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">n</span> = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>; <span class="hljs-built_in">n</span> &lt; matSize; <span class="hljs-built_in">n</span>++) &#123;<br>                        <span class="hljs-built_in">sum</span> = <span class="hljs-built_in">sum</span> + mat[<span class="hljs-built_in">n</span>][j];<br>                    &#125;<br>                    <span class="hljs-built_in">if</span> (<span class="hljs-built_in">sum</span> == <span class="hljs-number">2</span>) &#123;<br>                        <span class="hljs-built_in">count</span>++;<br>                    &#125;<br>                &#125;<br>                <span class="hljs-built_in">sum</span> = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>            &#125;<br>        &#125;<br>    &#125;<br>    return <span class="hljs-built_in">count</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="分析-3"><a href="#分析-3" class="headerlink" title="分析"></a>分析</h3><p>时间复杂度：O(M∗N∗(M+N)) 击败24.00%<br>空间复杂度：O(1) 击败16.00%</p><h2 id="LeetCode1758题目详情"><a href="#LeetCode1758题目详情" class="headerlink" title="LeetCode1758题目详情"></a>LeetCode1758<a href="https://leetcode.cn/problems/minimum-changes-to-make-alternating-binary-string/description/">题目详情</a></h2><h3 id="题目-3"><a href="#题目-3" class="headerlink" title="题目"></a>题目</h3><p>给你一个仅由字符 <code>&#39;0&#39;</code>和 <code>&#39;1&#39;</code> 组成的字符串 <code>s</code> 。一步操作中，你可以将任一 <code>&#39;0&#39;</code> 变成 <code>&#39;1&#39;</code> ，或者将 <code>&#39;1&#39;</code> 变成 <code>&#39;0&#39;</code> 。</p><p>交替字符串 定义为：如果字符串中不存在相邻两个字符相等的情况，那么该字符串就是交替字符串。例如，字符串 <code>&quot;010&quot;</code> 是交替字符串，而字符串 <code>&quot;0100&quot;</code> 不是。</p><p>返回使 <code>s</code> 变成 交替字符串 所需的 最少 操作数。</p><h3 id="思路-3"><a href="#思路-3" class="headerlink" title="思路"></a>思路</h3><p>题目特地指出替换操作，这是一步迷惑操作，分析知道，实际上交替字符只有两种情况： <code>&#39;1010...&#39;</code> ， <code>0101...&#39;</code> ，针对这两种情况，我们将字符串 <code>s</code> 分别对比即可。</p><h3 id="示例代码-2"><a href="#示例代码-2" class="headerlink" title="示例代码"></a>示例代码</h3><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;string.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">minOperations</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">char</span>* s)</span> </span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> len = <span class="hljs-built_in">strlen</span>(s);<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> sum1 = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>, sum2 = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>; i &lt; len; i++) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> ((i % <span class="hljs-number">2</span> == <span class="hljs-number">0</span> &amp;&amp; s[i] == <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;1&#x27;</span>) || (i % <span class="hljs-number">2</span> != <span class="hljs-number">0</span> &amp;&amp; s[i] == <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;0&#x27;</span>)) &#123;<br>            sum1++;<br>        &#125; <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> &#123;<br>            sum2++;<br>        &#125;<br>    &#125;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (sum1 &gt; sum2) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> sum2;<br>    &#125; <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> sum1;<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="分析-4"><a href="#分析-4" class="headerlink" title="分析"></a>分析</h3><p>时间复杂度：O(N) 击败100.00%<br>空间复杂度：O(1) 击败5.00%</p><h2 id="LeetCode1784题目详情"><a href="#LeetCode1784题目详情" class="headerlink" title="LeetCode1784题目详情"></a>LeetCode1784<a href="https://leetcode.cn/problems/check-if-binary-string-has-at-most-one-segment-of-ones/">题目详情</a></h2><h3 id="题目-4"><a href="#题目-4" class="headerlink" title="题目"></a>题目</h3><p>给你一个二进制字符串 <code>s</code> ，该字符串 <b>不含前导零</b> 。</p><p>如果 <code>s</code> 包含 <b>零个或一个由连续的 <code>&#39;1&#39;</code> 组成的字段</b> ，返回 <code>true</code>​​​ 。否则，返回 <code>false</code> 。</p><h3 id="思路-4"><a href="#思路-4" class="headerlink" title="思路"></a>思路</h3><p>没什么好说的，遇到 <code>1</code> 检查后面一个是不是 <code>1</code> 即可。当后一位不是 <code>1</code> 的时候，说明连续的 <code>1</code> 组成的字符串结束， 使用 <code>sum</code> 计数即可。</p><h3 id="示例代码-3"><a href="#示例代码-3" class="headerlink" title="示例代码"></a>示例代码</h3><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;string.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">bool</span> <span class="hljs-title">checkOnesSegment</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">char</span>* s)</span> </span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> len = <span class="hljs-built_in">strlen</span>(s), sum = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>; i &lt; len; i++) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (s[i] == <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;1&#x27;</span> &amp;&amp; s[i + <span class="hljs-number">1</span>] != <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;1&#x27;</span>) &#123;<br>            sum++;<br>        &#125;<br>    &#125;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (sum == <span class="hljs-number">0</span> || sum == <span class="hljs-number">1</span>) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>;<br>    &#125; <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">false</span>;<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="分析-5"><a href="#分析-5" class="headerlink" title="分析"></a>分析</h3><p>时间复杂度：O(N) 击败100.00%<br>空间复杂度：O(1) 击败6.12%</p>]]></content>
    
    
